  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kigali HFC Implementation Plan (Stage I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HFC implementation in Saint Lucia is a project designed to initiate the reduction of HFCs i accordance with the Kigali amendment. This phase focuses on establishing regulatory frameworks, enhancing technical expertise and encouraging the adoption of environmentally sustainable alternatives to HFCs, to decrease emissions and support climate change mitigation efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
